::
::  a wire mark: what a ship lists of the slips in its cabinet,
::  every slip at its path, less its text. a client reads the
::  cabinet through %chorus-shelf, which credits each stub to a nym
/-  chorus
|_  val=index:chorus
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  val
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  ,index:chorus
  --
--
